{"4557560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Necromancer Delivery Service", "steam_appid": 4557560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necromancer Delivery Service is a 3D physics-driven action racing game where players take on the role of a struggling necromancer forced into a delivery job in a chaotic city. Deliver packages, collect money and souls as tips, and use chaotic spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/4f862f2793a24a049b0fb584194a8a8f.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/4f862f2793a24a049b0fb584194a8a8f.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/4f862f2793a24a049b0fb584194a8a8f.mp4?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by arcade classics like Crazy Taxi, Necromancer Delivery Service captures the thrill of fast-paced, pick-up-and-play chaos with fun physics-based driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features Include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Vehicle Handling</strong><br>Master chaotic driving mechanics where momentum, crashes, and movement create unpredictable fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Inspired Delivery Gameplay</strong><br>Race against the clock to complete deliveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/0f1e1257e54bc59ed5be1d0e469eda3a.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/0f1e1257e54bc59ed5be1d0e469eda3a.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/0f1e1257e54bc59ed5be1d0e469eda3a.mp4?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Time Pressure Progression</strong><br>Manage limited time and plan efficient routes to survive increasingly difficult shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell-Driven Chaos</strong><br>Cast mischievous spells to manipulate the environment, cause destruction, and create opportunist shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/3b33cdbed6a2201d11c35654ac585c8c.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/3b33cdbed6a2201d11c35654ac585c8c.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/3b33cdbed6a2201d11c35654ac585c8c.mp4?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Magic System</strong><br>Collect souls as tips to improve spells and unlock new spells by progressing through the days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/811e014d7116e87f75e415fd26fff853.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/811e014d7116e87f75e415fd26fff853.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/811e014d7116e87f75e415fd26fff853.mp4?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character &amp; Car Customization</strong> <br>Personalize your necromancer and vehicle to deliver in style.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/721845b256f2de386c4b290347eaa4fb.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/721845b256f2de386c4b290347eaa4fb.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/721845b256f2de386c4b290347eaa4fb.mp4?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game aims to recapture the excitement of classic arcade games, offering fast-paced, bite-sized levels that are quick to jump into and feel rewarding. Players must complete all deliveries within a set time to earn money while collecting souls for spell upgrades and future experiments. Explore a chaotic, stylized city built like a chaotic playground. Experiment with physics, discover shortcuts, and create your own moments of mayhem with spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necromancer Delivery Service is a 3D physics-driven action racing game where players take on the role of a struggling necromancer forced into a delivery job in a chaotic city. Deliver packages, collect money and souls as tips, and use chaotic spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/4f862f2793a24a049b0fb584194a8a8f.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/4f862f2793a24a049b0fb584194a8a8f.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/4f862f2793a24a049b0fb584194a8a8f.mp4?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by arcade classics like Crazy Taxi, Necromancer Delivery Service captures the thrill of fast-paced, pick-up-and-play chaos with fun physics-based driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features Include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Vehicle Handling</strong><br>Master chaotic driving mechanics where momentum, crashes, and movement create unpredictable fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Inspired Delivery Gameplay</strong><br>Race against the clock to complete deliveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/0f1e1257e54bc59ed5be1d0e469eda3a.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/0f1e1257e54bc59ed5be1d0e469eda3a.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/0f1e1257e54bc59ed5be1d0e469eda3a.mp4?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Time Pressure Progression</strong><br>Manage limited time and plan efficient routes to survive increasingly difficult shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell-Driven Chaos</strong><br>Cast mischievous spells to manipulate the environment, cause destruction, and create opportunist shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/3b33cdbed6a2201d11c35654ac585c8c.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/3b33cdbed6a2201d11c35654ac585c8c.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/3b33cdbed6a2201d11c35654ac585c8c.mp4?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Magic System</strong><br>Collect souls as tips to improve spells and unlock new spells by progressing through the days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/811e014d7116e87f75e415fd26fff853.poster.avif?t=1784301995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/811e014d7116e87f75e415fd26fff853.webm?t=1784301995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557560/extras/811e014d7116e87f75e415fd26fff853.mp